Heptazip - license of the fork's code
====================================

(English translation of LICENSE-Heptazip. The license text itself, BSD-2-Clause, is the
same in both files.)

Heptazip is a fork of 7-Zip 26.05 (Igor Pavlov, https://7-zip.org). This file states
which license applies to each part of the code.

1. The code written for Heptazip

   The files created by Heptazip, i.e. those with the header

       SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-2-Clause
       Copyright (c) 2026 Mario Trombino

   (among others C/Float*.c/h, C/7zCrcClmul.h, C/LzFindMatchLen.h, the *Mt.cpp/h files
   of parallel extraction and compression, CPP/7zip/Compress/Float*,
   CPP/7zip/Compress/Zstd*, CPP/7zip/UI/Console/ListJson.*, the CMake build, the tests
   in tests/ and the tools in tools/) are distributed under the 2-clause BSD license
   reproduced below.

   Heptazip's changes to the 7-Zip files that 7-Zip distributes as public domain (most
   of C/, the LZMA SDK) are distributed under the same 2-clause BSD license, Copyright
   (c) 2026 Mario Trombino.

   The documentation in docs/, BUILD-modern.md, README.md and README.en.md: same
   license.

2. The 7-Zip code

   The rest of the code, and Heptazip's changes to the 7-Zip files distributed under
   the GNU LGPL, keep the 7-Zip licenses (GNU LGPL 2.1 or later, with the unRAR
   restriction for the RAR decompression code, and the parts under the BSD license):
   see DOC/License.txt. Copyright (c) 1999-2026 Igor Pavlov.

3. Third-party code

   third_party/zstd: Zstandard 1.5.7, Copyright (c) Meta Platforms, Inc. and
   affiliates, BSD license (third_party/zstd/LICENSE) or GPLv2 (COPYING), at your
   choice.

   third_party/libdeflate: the libdeflate compressor (master 0758d0a), Copyright 2016
   Eric Biggers, Copyright 2024 Google LLC, MIT license (third_party/libdeflate/COPYING);
   with Heptazip changes described in third_party/libdeflate/README-Heptazip.md.

   third_party/brotli: brotli 1.2.1, Copyright (c) 2009, 2010, 2013-2016 by the Brotli
   Authors, MIT license (third_party/brotli/LICENSE); unmodified.


